# Otter Project Inspector
#
# First self-hosted tooling milestone: discover every .ot file in a project
# and report its name. It deliberately uses only current Otter features.

say "Otter Project Inspector"
ask "What folder should I inspect?" and call it folder

try
    get files in folder and subfolders into files

    otterFiles are empty

    each file in files
        if extension of file is ".ot"
            add file to otterFiles
        .
    .

    say "Otter files found:" length of otterFiles

    each file in otterFiles
        say name of file
    .
otherwise
    error "The project could not be inspected."
.
